[E0337] Error: `T::unit` is a function of a type parameter, and is not a value
    ╭─[ err/371_functions_of_a_type_that_are_not_values/main.wip:39:13 ]
    │
 39 │     val make = T::unit
    │                ───┬───
    │                   ╰───── not called
    │
    │ Help 1: to call it, write `T::unit(…)`
    │
    │ Help 2: where a function is wanted, a lambda can call it: `() => T::unit()`
    │
    │ Note: what a type parameter's constraint answers is not a value yet: it can only be called
────╯
