[E0430] Error: `Grid::first` is `@inline`, so it cannot be a value
    ╭─[ err/371_functions_of_a_type_that_are_not_values/main.wip:47:16 ]
    │
 29 │     fn first(): i64 = self.cells[0]
    │     ───────┬───────
    │            ╰───────── declared `@inline` here
    │
 47 │     val inlined = Grid::first
    │                   ─────┬─────
    │                        ╰─────── taken as a value here
    │
    │ Help: write a lambda that calls it, or remove `@inline`
    │
    │ Note: `@inline` promises that every call to it is spliced into its caller, and a call through a value has no callee to splice
